 mb-1\">🐟</div><div class=\"text-sm font-semibold text-gray-700 group-hover:text-primary\">Dragonfish</div></a></div></section><section class=\"mt-12\"><h2 class=\"text-2xl font-bold mb-6\">📖 Related Naming Guides</h2><div class=\"grid grid-cols-1 sm:grid-cols-2 gap-3\"><a class=\"bg-white rounded-xl p-4 border border-gray-100 shadow-sm hover:shadow-md hover:border-primary/30 transition-all group flex items-center gap-3\" href=\"/guide/indian-animal-names/\"><span class=\"text-2xl\">📖</span><span class=\"text-sm font-semibold text-gray-700 group-hover:text-primary\">Indian Animal Names — 100+ Beautiful Ideas 🕉️</span></a><a class=\"bg-white rounded-xl p-4 border border-gray-100 shadow-sm hover:shadow-md hover:border-primary/30 transition-all group flex items-center gap-3\" href=\"/guide/how-to-name-your-canary/\"><span class=\"text-2xl\">📖</span><span class=\"text-sm font-semibold text-gray-700 group-hover:text-primary\">How to Name Your Canary — Complete Guide 🐦</span></a><a class=\"bg-white rounded-xl p-4 border border-gray-100 shadow-sm hover:shadow-md hover:border-primary/30 transition-all group flex items-center gap-3\" href=\"/guide/creative-bird-names/\"><span class=\"text-2xl\">📖</span><span class=\"text-sm font-semibold text-gray-700 group-hover:text-primary\">Creative Bird Names — Top Creative Picks 🐦</span></a><a class=\"bg-white rounded-xl p-4 border border-gray-100 shadow-sm hover:shadow-md hover:border-primary/30 transition-all group flex items-center gap-3\" href=\"/guide/unique-birds-names/\"><span class=\"text-2xl\">📖</span><span class=\"text-sm font-semibold text-gray-700 group-hover:text-primary\">Unique Birds Names — 100+ Ideas 🌟</span></a><a class=\"bg-white rounded-xl p-4 border border-gray-100 shadow-sm hover:shadow-md hover:border-primary/30 transition-all group flex items-center gap-3\" href=\"/guide/how-to-name-your-budgie/\"><span class=\"text-2xl\">📖</span><span class=\"text-sm font-semibold text-gray-700 group-hover:text-primary\">How to Name Your Budgie — Complete Guide 🦜</span></a><a class=\"bg-white rounded-xl p-4 border border-gray-100 shadow-sm hover:shadow-md hover:border-primary/30 transition-all group flex items-center gap-3\" href=\"/guide/creative-horse-names/\"><span class=\"text-2xl\">📖</span><span class=\"text-sm font-semibold text-gray-700 group-hover:text-primary\">Creative Horse Names — Top Creative Picks 🐴</span></a></div></section><section class=\"mt-12\"><h2 class=\"text-2xl font-bold mb-6\">📝 Related Articles</h2><div class=\"grid grid-cols-1 sm:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-3 gap-4\"><a class=\"bg-white rounded-xl p-5 border border-gray-100 shadow-sm hover:shadow-md hover:border-primary/30 transition-all group\" href=\"/blog/animal-names-from-movies-tv-shows/\"><div class=\"text-3xl mb-3\">🎬</div><span class=\"text-xs bg-primary/10 text-primary font-semibold px-2 py-0.5 rounded-full\">Creative Names</span><h3 class=\"text-sm font-bold text-gray-800 mt-2 group-hover:text-primary line-clamp-2\">Animal Names from Movies &amp; TV Shows: 200+ Iconic Screen-Inspired Pet Names</h3><p class=\"text-xs text-gray-500 mt-1 line-clamp-2\">Discover the best animal names from movies and TV shows. From Star Wars to Disney classics, find iconic screen-inspired pet names that bring cinematic magic to your companion.</p></a><a class=\"bg-white rounded-xl p-5 border border-gray-100 shadow-sm hover:shadow-md hover:border-primary/30 transition-all group\" href=\"/blog/animal-names-from-folklore-mythology-world-cultures/\"><div class=\"text-3xl mb-3\">🏛️</div><span class=\"text-xs bg-primary/10 text-primary font-semibold px-2 py-0.5 rounded-full\">Creative Names</span><h3 class=\"text-sm font-bold text-gray-800 mt-2 group-hover:text-primary line-clamp-2\">Animal Names from Folklore &amp; Mythology: 200+ Legendary Names Across World Cultures</h3><p class=\"text-xs text-gray-500 mt-1 line-clamp-2\">Discover powerful animal names from folklore and mythology around the globe. From Greek gods to Celtic legends, find mythical pet names that carry ancient meaning and storytelling magic.</p></a><a class=\"bg-white rounded-xl p-5 border border-gray-100 shadow-sm hover:shadow-md hover:border-primary/30 transition-all group\" href=\"/blog/animal-names-from-literature-book-inspired/\"><div class=\"text-3xl mb-3\">📚</div><span class=\"text-xs bg-primary/10 text-primary font-semibold px-2 py-0.5 rounded-full\">Creative Names</span><h3 class=\"text-sm font-bold text-gray-800 mt-2 group-hover:text-primary line-clamp-2\">Animal Names From Literature: 200+ Book-Inspired Names for Your Pet</h3><p class=\"text-xs text-gray-500 mt-1 line-clamp-2\">Find the perfect literary name for your pet. From Shakespeare to modern classics, discover 200+ animal names from literature that bring stories to life through your companion.</p></a><a class=\"bg-white rounded-xl p-5 border border-gray-100 shadow-sm hover:shadow-md hover:border-primary/30 transition-all group\" href=\"/blog/artistic-creative-pet-names-inspired/\"><div class=\"text-3xl mb-3\">🎨</div><span class=\"text-xs bg-primary/10 text-primary font-semibold px-2 py-0.5 rounded-full\">Creative Names</span><h3 class=\"text-sm font-bold text-gray-800 mt-2 group-hover:text-primary line-clamp-2\">Artistic and Creative Pet Names: 140+ Inspired Ideas from Art, Music, and Literature</h3><p class=\"text-xs text-gray-500 mt-1 line-clamp-2\">140+ artistic pet names from famous painters, composers, writers, and creative movements. Beautiful, cultured names for pets with artistic souls and creative spirits.</p></a><a class=\"bg-white rounded-xl p-5 border border-gray-100 shadow-sm hover:shadow-md hover:border-primary/30 transition-all group\" href=\"/blog/best-animal-names-for-aquatic-pets/\"><div class=\"text-3xl mb-3\">🐠</div><span class=\"text-xs bg-primary/10 text-primary font-semibold px-2 py-0.5 rounded-full\">Naming Tips</span><h3 class=\"text-sm font-bold text-gray-800 mt-2 group-hover:text-primary line-clamp-2\">Best Animal Names for Aquatic Pets: Fish, Turtles &amp; More 🐠</h3><p class=\"text-xs text-gray-500 mt-1 line-clamp-2\">Dive into the best names for your aquatic companions. From goldfish and bettas to turtles and axolotls, discover 200+ creative water-inspired pet names.</p></a><a class=\"bg-white rounded-xl p-5 border border-gray-100 shadow-sm hover:shadow-md hover:border-primary/30 transition-all group\" href=\"/blog/the-ultimate-guide-to-playful-snowy-owl-names-175-ideas-for-every-snowy-owl-owner/\"><div class=\"text-3xl mb-3\">🐾</div><span class=\"text-xs bg-primary/10 text-primary font-semibold px-2 py-0.5 rounded-full\">Snowy Owl Names</span><h3 class=\"text-sm font-bold text-gray-800 mt-2 group-hover:text-primary line-clamp-2\">The Ultimate Guide to Playful Snowy Owl Names: 175+ Ideas for Every Snowy Owl Owner</h3><p class=\"text-xs text-gray-500 mt-1 line-clamp-2\">From inspired by music inspirations to classic favorites, discover 175+ playful snowy owl names that capture your snowy owl&#x27;s unique personality.</p></a></div></section><nav class=\"mt-12 grid grid-cols-2 gap-4\" aria-label=\"Post navigation\"><a class=\"bg-white rounded-xl p-4 border border-gray-100 shadow-sm hover:shadow-md hover:border-primary/30 transition-all group text-left\" href=\"/blog/animal-names-from-folklore-mythology-world-cultures/\"><span class=\"text-xs text-gray-500\">← Previous Post</span><p class=\"text-sm font-semibold text-gray-700 group-hover:text-primary mt-1 line-clamp-1\">Animal Names from Folklore &amp; Mythology: 200+ Legendary Names Across World Cultures</p></a><a class=\"bg-white rounded-xl p-4 border border-gray-100 shadow-sm hover:shadow-md hover:border-primary/30 transition-all group text-right\" href=\"/blog/chinese-animal-names-symbolism-meaning/\"><span class=\"text-xs text-gray-500\">Next Post →</span><p class=\"text-sm font-semibold text-gray-700 group-hover:text-primary mt-1 line-clamp-1\">Chinese Animal Names: Symbolism, Meaning &amp; 200+ Beautiful Choices</p></a></nav><div class=\